<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[International Business Identifier (IBID)](https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/) is a verifiable unique identifier for legal entities as defined in the [ISO/DIS 25500-3](https://www.iso.org/standard/87705.html) draft standard. It is composed of three data elements: the International Business Registration Number (IBRN), the legal name, and the date of origin formatted as eight numeric characters (YYYYMMDD). Each element is separated by a pipe character (`|`) (e.g., `US-DE.BER:3031657|Code Management Association|19990420`)."@en .
_:Nee45b8cfac374a2a8061e08fd914ed6e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Ne6715e826c904d46baaf5cc918038614 .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/blake2b384> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ark> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Archival Resource Key (ARK)](https://arks.org/about/), is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) suited to being a persistent identifier for information objects of any type, standardized by the [ARK Identifier Scheme](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-kunze-ark/) Internet-Draft. It consists of the \"ark:\" label followed by a Name Assigning Authority Number, a forward slash, a name, and an optional qualifier (e.g., `ark:12148/btv1b8449691v/f29`)."@en .
